    "body": "Three new Tapleaf 0xc2 (GSR) drafts, building on BIP 440 and BIP 441 as revised in #2358.\n\n- OP_TX: transaction introspection\n- Extended Primitives: OP_CHECKSIGFROMSTACK, OP_TWEAKADD and OP_BYTEREV\n- Reusable Macros: OP_MACRO and OP_CALLMACRO\n",
